sequenceDiagram
  actor K as Klien
  actor P as Pelamar
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  K->>FE: Post lowongan
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/lowongan
  API->>DB: INSERT jobs OPEN is_active 1

  P->>FE: Lamar + penawaran
  FE->>API: POST /lowongan/:id/lamar
  API->>DB: INSERT applications PENDING
  API-->>FE: notifikasi ke klien

  alt klien terima satu
    K->>FE: Terima pelamar
    FE->>API: POST /applications/:id/terima
    API->>DB: ACCEPTED + job FILLED
    API->>DB: pelamar lain AUTO_FILLED
    API->>DB: INSERT orders
  else klien Tutup
    K->>FE: Tutup lowongan
    FE->>API: POST /lowongan/:id/tutup
    API->>DB: PENDING jadi JOB_CLOSED
    API->>DB: jobs CANCELLED
  else hapus tanpa pelamar
    K->>FE: Hapus
    FE->>API: DELETE /lowongan/:id
    API->>DB: CANCELLED + unlist
  end
